  "and choose a bot for the other seat, then start the match. Two Human seats can also share the same device.": "，为另一席位选择 Bot 后开始。也可以在同一设备上配置两名玩家。",
  "moves first. Wait for the turn indicator to show your Human seat.": "先手。等待提示轮到你的玩家席位。",
  "Click or tap a column with free space to drop a disc. It falls into the lowest empty cell; you cannot choose the row.": "点击仍有空位的列即可落子。棋子会落到该列最低的空格，不能自行选择行。",
