  "must be an integer in 0–6 identifying a non-full column. A supplied": "必须是 0–6 的整数，指向尚未填满的列。若提供了",
  "is ignored; gravity determines the row.": "则会忽略该值，落子行由重力决定。",
  "Both coordinates must be integers in 0–": "两个坐标都必须是 0–",
  "and identify an empty cell. Strings, fractions, and booleans are not valid coordinates.": "内的整数，并指向一个空格。字符串、小数和布尔值均不是合法坐标。",
  "Two players alternate turns;": "双方轮流落子；",
  "starts.": "先手。",
  "Play on a 15×15 board. The first player to connect at least five stones horizontally, vertically, or diagonally wins. Overlines also win; this implementation has no forbidden-move rules.": "棋盘为 15×15。率先将至少五枚棋子连成横线、竖线或斜线者获胜。超过五连也获胜，本实现没有禁手规则。",
  "Play on a 7-column × 6-row board. Discs fall to the lowest empty cell in the chosen column. The first player to connect four discs horizontally, vertically, or diagonally wins.": "棋盘为七列六行，棋子落到每列最低的空格。率先横向、纵向或斜向连成四子者获胜。",
  "Play on a 3×3 board. The first player to complete a row, column, or diagonal of three matching marks wins.": "棋盘为 3×3。率先横向、纵向或斜向连成三个相同标记者获胜。",
  "If the board fills without a winner, the game is a draw.": "棋盘填满且无人获胜时为平局。",
  "Choosing a full column or an out-of-range column": "选择已满的列或范围外的列",
  "Choosing an occupied cell or an out-of-range cell": "选择已占据或范围外的格子",
  "forfeits the game. Leaving while your Human seat is waiting for a move also forfeits.": "会被判负。在等待玩家操作时离开对局也会被判负。",
  "Each decision starts a fresh bot process. Read one JSON object from stdin, print exactly one JSON object to stdout, then exit. Rebuild state from the supplied history; global variables do not persist between turns. Send debug messages to stderr.": "每次决策都会启动新的 Bot 进程。从 stdin 读取一个 JSON 对象，向 stdout 输出且仅输出一个 JSON 对象，然后退出。请根据输入历史重建状态，回合之间不会保留全局变量。调试信息应输出到 stderr。",
  "The execution time limit is 1 second per decision. A crash, timeout, malformed output, or illegal action forfeits the game. Human games do not change Bot Elo; completed matches between distinct bots update their ratings.": "每次决策限时 1 秒。程序崩溃、超时、输出格式错误或非法动作均会被判负。包含玩家的对局不改变 Bot Elo；不同 Bot 之间完成的对局会更新评分。",
  "Sign in, create a": "登录后，从",
  "match from Game Tables on": "的游戏桌台创建",
  ", choose one Human seat and a bot opponent, then start the match.": "对局，选择一个玩家席位和一个 Bot 对手，然后开始。",
  "Use": "使用",
  "W / A / S / D": "W / A / S / D",
  "or the": "或",
  "arrow keys": "方向键",
  "to move up / left / down / right. On a small screen, tap the on-screen directional buttons.": "向上、左、下、右移动。小屏幕可点击屏幕上的方向按钮。",
  "Choose one direction for each turn. The server waits for both players' decisions before advancing; this is a turn-based game, not continuous movement.": "每回合选择一次方向。服务器收齐双方决策后才推进回合，这是回合制游戏，不是连续移动。",
  "Avoid walls, obstacles, and snake bodies. Only one Human seat is supported per match. Spectating and replaying do not accept movement input.": "避开墙壁、障碍和蛇身。每场仅支持一个玩家席位，观战与回放模式不接受移动输入。",
  "This starter reconstructs both snakes from the history and chooses an immediately unoccupied neighboring cell. It works with both Snake and Mini Snake by reading the supplied dimensions. It does not predict the opponent's next move.": "此示例根据历史重建双方蛇身，并选择相邻且当前未被占据的格子。它会读取输入尺寸，因此同时适用于贪吃蛇和迷你贪吃蛇，不预测对手的下一步。",
  "Read one JSON object with": "从 stdin 读取一个包含",
