  "Snake uses": "贪吃蛇使用",
  "one-based coordinates": "从 1 开始的坐标",
  "is the row (1–height, downward) and": "表示行（1–height，向下递增），",
  "is the column (1–width, rightward). This differs from the board games.": "表示列（1–width，向右递增），这与棋类游戏不同。",
  "contains": "包含",
  ", your starting": "、你的起点",
  ", an array of blocked coordinates. Your snake starts at (1,1) or (height,width); the opponent starts at the opposite corner.": "及障碍坐标数组。你的蛇从 (1,1) 或 (height,width) 出发，对手从对角出发。",
  "contains the opponent's previous": "包含对手之前的",
  "moves.": "动作。",
  "contains your own previous moves, without the outer": "包含自己的历史动作，不带外层",
  "wrapper. Pair": "包装。将",
  "with": "与",
  "to reconstruct completed turn": "配对，即可重建已完成的回合",
  "Directions are": "方向编码为",
  "0=up, 1=right, 2=down, 3=left": "0=上、1=右、2=下、3=左",
  ". The example moves right. A direction must be an integer in 0–3.": "。示例向右移动，方向必须是 0–3 的整数。",
  "Two snakes begin with length 1 at opposite corners. Both players choose a direction each turn; each head advances one cell.": "两条蛇初始长度为 1，分别位于对角。每回合双方各选一个方向，蛇头移动一格。",
  "Mini Snake": "迷你贪吃蛇",
  "uses a fixed 10-row × 11-column map with randomly generated, centrally symmetric obstacles. Movement, growth, and the Bot protocol are the same as Snake.": "使用固定的 10 行 × 11 列地图，随机生成中心对称的障碍。移动、生长规则及 Bot 协议与贪吃蛇相同。",
  "Snake": "贪吃蛇",
  "generates a map with 10–13 rows and 11–17 columns, with an odd sum of height and width and centrally symmetric obstacles. Read the actual dimensions from the input.": "生成 10–13 行、11–17 列的地图，行列数之和为奇数，障碍中心对称。请从输入读取实际尺寸。",
  "There is no food. Snakes grow every turn for turns 1–25, then on turns 28, 31, 34, and so on. On other turns, both tails are removed before moves are checked, so a vacated tail cell can be entered.": "没有食物。第 1–25 回合每回合生长，此后在第 28、31、34 等回合生长。其他回合会先移除双方尾部再检查移动，因此可以进入刚腾出的尾格。",
  "Moving outside the map, into an obstacle, or into either snake's remaining body kills the snake. If both heads enter the same cell, both snakes die.": "移出地图、撞上障碍或任一条蛇尚未移除的身体会死亡。若双方蛇头进入同一格，则同时死亡。",
  "If one snake dies, the survivor wins. If both die on the same turn, the game is a draw. The platform ends surviving matches at 200 turns as a draw.": "一条蛇死亡时另一方获胜；同回合同时死亡为平局。双方存活至 200 回合时，平台判为平局。",
  "Invalid direction values or malformed responses forfeit the game. Leaving while the Human seat is waiting also forfeits.": "方向值无效或响应格式错误会被判负。等待玩家操作时离开对局也会被判负。",
  "Sign in and create a Tank Battle match from Game Tables on": "登录后，从",
  ", setting one or both seats to Human, then start the match.": "的游戏桌台创建坦克大战对局，将一方或双方设为玩家，然后开始。",
  "Each side commands two tanks. Hover over or tap a friendly tank to show its order controls. Follow the order indicator to see which side is answering.": "每方指挥两辆坦克。悬停或点击己方坦克可显示指令控件，轮到哪一方下令会有提示。",
  "Use a directional button to move one cell. Toggle the central fire button, then choose a direction to shoot. Select": "使用方向按钮移动一格。点击中央开火按钮后选择射击方向；选择",
  "to stay still. Disabled actions are currently illegal.": "可原地待命。禁用的动作表示当前不合法。",
  "Order every surviving tank. The pair of orders is submitted automatically when both tanks have orders; destroyed tanks require no input.": "为所有存活坦克下令。当两辆坦克都有指令后自动提交，已毁坦克无需输入。",
  "Both sides act in the same round. If both seats are Human, the same device collects orders for each seat in turn. Spectators and replays cannot issue orders.": "双方在同一回合行动。若双方均为玩家，则在同一设备上轮流收集指令。观战和回放模式不能下令。",
  "This minimal starter stays in place and randomly fires when the cooldown permits. It demonstrates the two-tank output format without requiring a full battlefield simulator.": "此最小示例会原地待命，并在冷却允许时随机开火。它展示了双坦克输出格式，无需实现完整战场模拟器。",
  "Read one JSON object containing": "从 stdin 读取一个包含",
  "from stdin. Write one JSON object containing a two-element": "的 JSON 对象，向 stdout 输出一个包含两个元素的",
  "array to stdout.": "数组的 JSON 对象。",
  "Input history": "输入历史",
  "(0=Blue/top, 1=Red/bottom) and the initial terrain arrays": "（0=蓝方/上方，1=红方/下方）及初始地形数组",
  "contains the opponent's previous two-tank actions, in round order.": "按回合顺序包含对手之前的双坦克动作。",
  "contains your own previous two-tank actions. For completed round": "包含自己的双坦克历史动作。对于已完成回合",
  ", pair": "，将",
  ". These arrays store action values directly, without the outer": "配对。这些数组直接保存动作值，不带外层",
  "Coordinates and terrain": "坐标与地形",
  "The battlefield is 9×9 with zero-based coordinates:": "战场为 9×9，坐标从零开始：",
  "increases rightward and": "向右递增，",
  "downward. Blue tanks 0 and 1 start at (2,0) and (6,0); Red tanks 0 and 1 start at (6,8) and (2,8). Bases are at (4,0) and (4,8).": "向下递增。蓝方坦克 0、1 位于 (2,0)、(6,0)；红方坦克 0、1 位于 (6,8)、(2,8)。双方基地位于 (4,0)、(4,8)。",
  "Each terrain array contains three 27-bit masks. Array element": "每个地形数组包含三个 27 位掩码。数组元素",
  "describes rows": "描述第",
  "through": "至",
  ". Cell (x,y) is occupied when": "行。当",
  "equals 1. Replay both players' histories to track tanks, destroyed terrain, and cooldowns.": "等于 1 时，格子 (x,y) 被占据。请重放双方历史以跟踪坦克、被摧毁地形与冷却状态。",
  "Output and action codes": "输出与动作编码",
  "The first entry orders tank 0, the second tank 1. In this example tank 0 moves down and tank 1 holds. Use": "第一项指挥坦克 0，第二项指挥坦克 1。本例中坦克 0 向下移动、坦克 1 原地待命。已毁坦克的指令使用",
  "for a destroyed tank's slot.": "。",
  "Action": "动作",
  "Code": "编码",
  "Hold": "待命",
  "Move up / right / down / left": "向上 / 右 / 下 / 左移动",
  "Fire up / right / down / left": "向上 / 右 / 下 / 左射击",
  "Each side has one base and two tanks. Both players choose orders before the round is resolved; tanks move before shots are resolved.": "每方有一个基地和两辆坦克。双方先下令，再结算回合；先移动，后结算射击。",
  "A move advances one cell and must target an empty in-bounds cell in the current battlefield. Bricks, steel, water, bases, and currently occupied tank cells block movement.": "每次移动一格，目标必须在地图内且当前为空。砖墙、钢墙、水域、基地和被坦克占据的格子均不能进入。",
  "A shot travels in a straight line to the first blocking object. It can destroy bricks, tanks (including friendly tanks), and bases. Steel blocks shots and survives; shots pass over water.": "炮弹沿直线飞行，遇到首个阻挡物停止。可以摧毁砖墙、坦克（包括己方坦克）和基地；钢墙阻挡炮弹且不会被摧毁，炮弹可以穿过水域。",
  "A tank cannot shoot in two consecutive rounds. It must move or hold on the following round.": "坦克不能连续两个回合射击，下一回合必须移动或待命。",
  "A side loses when its base is destroyed or both of its tanks are destroyed. If both sides lose in the same round, the game is a draw.": "基地被毁或两辆坦克均被毁时，该方失败。双方同回合失败为平局。",
  "The default round limit is 100. If both sides survive that limit, the game is a draw.": "默认回合上限为 100，双方存活到上限时为平局。",
  "Malformed orders or illegal actions for a surviving tank forfeit the game. Destroyed tanks' orders are ignored. Opposing single tanks shooting directly at one another in opposite directions cancel those shots.": "对存活坦克提交格式错误或非法指令会被判负；已毁坦克的指令会被忽略。敌对的两辆坦克沿相反方向直接对射时，两发炮弹相互抵消。",
